      "entries": [
        "Mogaran exhales ghostly green fire in a 60-foot cone. Living creatures in the area take 18d6 negative damage (DC 38 basic Reflex save). A good creature that fails this save becomes stupefied 2 for 1 minute (stupefied 4 on a critical failure). A creature slain by Soulfire Breath can't be resurrected except by powerful magic such as a wish spell. Mogaran can't use Soulfire Breath again for 1d4 rounds."
      ],
